728	     * case-insensitively (surrounding whitespace trimmed). The count reflects the state before the
729	     * new owner is persisted, so it excludes the owner being created.
730	     *
731	     * @param firstName the first name of the owner being created
732	     * @param lastName the last name of the owner being created
733	     * @return the number of existing owners with the same first and last name
734	     */
